			"notes": "feat: Initial release of MineOpBot\n成就：MineOpBot 首次发布\nA Fabric mod for Minecraft 1.21.4 that integrates an AI assistant\n一个集成 AI 助手的 Minecraft 1.21.4 Fabric 模组\ninto the game through OpenAI-compatible APIs.\n通过兼容 OpenAI 的 API 进入游戏。\n\nFeatures:  特色：\n\nAI chat integration with streaming response support\nAI 聊天集成支持流式响应\nAction system for AI to execute Minecraft commands\nAI 执行 Minecraft 命令的动作系统\nMulti-configuration management with runtime switching\n多配置管理与运行时切换\nUser Information Mode (UIM) for player state context\n用户信息模式（UIM）用于玩家状态上下文\nSession-based chat history per player\n每个玩家的会话聊天记录\nModules:  模块：\n\nCommand Module: /mineopbot chat, config, status\n指令模块：/mineopbot 聊天、配置、状态\nAI Module: LangChain4j integration, config management\nAI 模块：LangChain4j 集成，配置管理\nAction Module: command_execute action\n行动模块：command_execute 行动"
